Package: kolinos-branding
Architecture: @KOLIN_DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: KolinOS <dev@kolinos.org>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: bash
Description: KolinOS visual identity assets
 Logo, colour palette and shell colour helpers used by KolinOS tooling and by
 its motd. Installed under /etc/kolinos/branding. Also ships the graphical
 wallpaper, logo and icon assets rendered from the SVG sources (Corvo Glass,
 FASE 7) under /usr/share/backgrounds/kolinos and /usr/share/icons/hicolor.
